WEBVTT

00:00:00.980 --> 00:00:02.270
Chara-su!

00:00:02.270 --> 00:00:05.150
Is everyone shugo-shugo-peppy today?

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:08.110
It's time to start Shugo Chara Party!

00:00:08.410 --> 00:00:10.080
Let's enjoy it together!

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:12.790
Everyone's Hearts: Unlock!

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:22.120
My heart: Unlock!

00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:26.350
Open up my heart!

00:00:26.350 --> 00:00:29.490
Face straight ahead, going on!

00:00:29.490 --> 00:00:32.920
We're going on forever!

00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:37.190
There's nothing to fear!

00:00:37.190 --> 00:00:44.300
Lately it feels like things have changed a bit...

00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:50.500
And it's, well, kind of nice, you know?

00:00:51.060 --> 00:00:54.690
Doesn't matter who you are, if you don't give up,

00:00:54.690 --> 00:00:58.190
you'll fly farther than you did today.

00:00:58.190 --> 00:01:01.840
Even if you cry a bunch, and get depressed,

00:01:01.840 --> 00:01:04.660
the morning will still come! So!

00:01:05.020 --> 00:01:07.910
Negative heart: Lock on!

00:01:07.910 --> 00:01:11.800
You'll find the courage!

00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:15.050
Hold your head high, going on!

00:01:15.050 --> 00:01:18.780
Continue on to tomorrow!

00:01:19.090 --> 00:01:21.970
Your heart: Unlock!

00:01:21.970 --> 00:01:25.850
Open up your heart!

00:01:25.850 --> 00:01:29.020
Face straight ahead, going on!

00:01:29.020 --> 00:01:32.580
We're going on forever!

00:01:32.580 --> 00:01:36.660
There's nothing to fear!

00:01:46.320 --> 00:01:48.820
Shugo Chara Pucchi Puchi!

00:01:48.820 --> 00:01:51.630
"First Calligraphy of the New Year."

00:01:54.580 --> 00:01:56.370
Let's get it started!

00:01:56.370 --> 00:01:58.950
The first Shugo Chara Pucchi
Puchi of the new year!

00:01:58.950 --> 00:02:03.450
Today we'll be introducing what everyone wrote
for their first calligraphy of the new year!

00:02:03.450 --> 00:02:06.970
It's where you write words you
like or goals for the new year.

00:02:06.970 --> 00:02:09.750
So, let's take a look at the first person!

00:02:09.750 --> 00:02:12.540
"Rule the Universe!!" - Kiseki.

00:02:12.540 --> 00:02:15.140
So he's aiming for space this year?

00:02:15.140 --> 00:02:19.100
Well, the entire universe might
be a bit small for my ambition!

00:02:19.100 --> 00:02:22.370
Even though he hasn't even
conquered the world yet...

00:02:22.370 --> 00:02:25.700
But, big dreamers sure are wonderful...

00:02:26.370 --> 00:02:29.220
Um, I wonder who's next?

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:33.550
This looks like Rhythm's writing,
but I can't read it.

00:02:33.550 --> 00:02:35.900
It says "Soul Brother!"

00:02:35.900 --> 00:02:38.050
What does that mean?

00:02:38.050 --> 00:02:39.940
Souls that are brothers?

00:02:39.940 --> 00:02:40.930
Exactly!

00:02:40.930 --> 00:02:42.130
Yay!

00:02:42.130 --> 00:02:45.030
Passionate people are also really cool!

00:02:45.740 --> 00:02:47.770
M-Moving on...

00:02:48.270 --> 00:02:50.850
"Best Wishes for a Happy
New Year." - Temari.

00:02:50.850 --> 00:02:54.000
And may you see happiness
for the year ahead.

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:56.890
You are really skilled, Temari-chan!

00:02:57.570 --> 00:02:58.920
Next up is:

00:02:59.630 --> 00:03:01.760
"Milk." - Pepe.

00:03:01.760 --> 00:03:03.330
Got it-dechu?

00:03:03.330 --> 00:03:05.990
But writing "Milk" for your first calligraphy?

00:03:05.990 --> 00:03:09.330
Don't think about it too much-dechu.

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:10.920
Deep!

00:03:10.920 --> 00:03:12.510
I suppose...

00:03:12.510 --> 00:03:14.060
Who could be next?

00:03:14.660 --> 00:03:15.860
A fish print?

00:03:15.860 --> 00:03:17.360
Who could have made this?

00:03:17.360 --> 00:03:18.340
Me!

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:20.900
It's in honor of a yummy fish I got-nya!

00:03:22.370 --> 00:03:24.290
He never changes, does he?

00:03:24.290 --> 00:03:26.110
Let's see the next one!

00:03:26.750 --> 00:03:28.420
It's a heart mark...

00:03:28.420 --> 00:03:29.460
Love!

00:03:29.460 --> 00:03:33.170
El's a hunk of burning red
love this year as well!

00:03:33.170 --> 00:03:36.350
And my first calligraphy is this!

00:03:36.050 --> 00:03:43.400
"Il wuz here"

00:03:37.850 --> 00:03:40.280
You'd better watch yourself this year, El!

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:42.720
Il!

00:03:43.360 --> 00:03:45.070
Uh...

00:03:45.070 --> 00:03:45.970
Huh?

00:03:45.970 --> 00:03:49.080
Now that I think about it,
Kusukusu-chan hasn't finished yet.

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:50.260
Tada!

00:03:50.260 --> 00:03:52.970
Snip, snip, snip...

00:03:52.970 --> 00:03:55.410
Bala-balance, finished!

00:03:57.590 --> 00:03:58.570
But...

00:03:58.570 --> 00:04:00.820
...that's not calligraphy, is it?

00:04:00.820 --> 00:04:02.960
Then finally, it's our turn.

00:04:02.960 --> 00:04:04.060
Yeah!

00:04:04.060 --> 00:04:05.080
Have a...

00:04:05.080 --> 00:04:06.300
...Happy...

00:04:06.300 --> 00:04:07.280
...New Year...

00:04:07.280 --> 00:04:08.050
...and Best Wishes...

00:04:08.280 --> 00:04:11.330
...for the Next!

00:04:09.760 --> 00:04:11.930
See you again!

00:04:13.340 --> 00:04:15.070
Shugo Chara Encyclopedia!

00:04:15.070 --> 00:04:17.910
The first Character we'll
introduce today is...

00:04:18.690 --> 00:04:20.190
X Dia!

00:04:22.150 --> 00:04:27.180
Because of Amu-chan's negative heart,
her fourth egg got an X put on it!

00:04:27.180 --> 00:04:30.060
And it hatched into X Dia!

00:04:32.400 --> 00:04:37.800
But thanks to Amu-chan believing in her
own radiance, the X was removed!

00:04:47.370 --> 00:04:49.990
The second Character we'll introduce is...

00:04:51.130 --> 00:04:52.390
Snoppe!

00:04:53.210 --> 00:04:58.240
Snoppe is a snow fairy who was born
from an egg with a snowflake on it!

00:04:58.240 --> 00:05:03.270
She's the Guardian Character of Amu-chan's
class's snowboard instructor, Mifuyu!

00:05:05.170 --> 00:05:10.060
When Mifuyu lost confidence,
she became an X Character!

00:05:14.980 --> 00:05:17.810
We'll keep doing these Shugo Chara
Encyclopedia's each week!

00:05:18.620 --> 00:05:20.270
Look forward to it!

00:05:22.630 --> 00:05:26.170
Shugo-shugo Open Heart Game!

00:05:26.670 --> 00:05:32.370
We're going to be doing another personality
test that'll find out who you really are!

00:05:34.440 --> 00:05:37.250
Everyone at home, you play along too!

00:05:37.250 --> 00:05:38.760
Here's the question:

00:05:39.490 --> 00:05:42.860
Today's the day Shugo Chara
Party is filming!

00:05:42.860 --> 00:05:45.880
It's an important day, but
you forgot something!

00:05:45.880 --> 00:05:47.370
What did you forget?

00:05:47.370 --> 00:05:49.910
Choose from these four items, 'kay!

00:05:51.170 --> 00:05:52.820
How about you, Clover?

00:05:52.820 --> 00:05:54.090
Candy!

00:05:54.090 --> 00:05:55.300
And you, Heart?

00:05:55.300 --> 00:05:56.420
Handkerchief!

00:05:56.420 --> 00:05:57.480
And you, Diamond?

00:05:57.480 --> 00:05:58.780
Handkerchief!

00:05:58.780 --> 00:05:59.460
Spade?

00:05:59.750 --> 00:06:01.690
My cellphone.

00:06:01.690 --> 00:06:04.650
Has everyone at home
made up their minds?

00:06:07.470 --> 00:06:10.700
Well then, it's time to
announce the results!

00:06:11.200 --> 00:06:13.250
What we'll find out today is...

00:06:13.250 --> 00:06:16.730
How old you'll be when you get married!

00:06:17.970 --> 00:06:22.090
First, those of you who chose the band-aid...
You'll get married right out of high school!

00:06:22.090 --> 00:06:25.670
You're the type of person who wants to be
protected by someone older than you.

00:06:26.760 --> 00:06:30.020
For you who chose the handkerchief,
you'll get married around 25!

00:06:30.020 --> 00:06:32.170
That's about the right age, don't you think?

00:06:33.030 --> 00:06:36.000
Later might be better, you know?

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:37.680
I see.

00:06:37.680 --> 00:06:39.970
I think a little earlier is better.

00:06:39.970 --> 00:06:41.010
Got it!

00:06:41.650 --> 00:06:45.830
Next up... For those of you who chose the
cellphone, you'll be married around 30!

00:06:45.830 --> 00:06:48.080
Your destined partner might show up!

00:06:48.080 --> 00:06:49.920
Good for you, Spade!

00:06:52.240 --> 00:06:55.760
And for you, who are always
carrying around candy...

00:06:55.990 --> 00:06:57.380
You'll get married around 40!

00:06:58.760 --> 00:07:00.710
I'm shocked!

00:07:00.710 --> 00:07:04.810
People who carry around pointless things
are overly cautious, so they say.

00:07:05.570 --> 00:07:07.790
But, at least you'll have candy, right?

00:07:07.790 --> 00:07:08.890
You're not helping.

00:07:09.940 --> 00:07:15.950
What we found out is that Clover will
be the last one to get married!

00:07:17.400 --> 00:07:19.990
Everyone at home, what do you think?

00:07:19.990 --> 00:07:24.250
Stay tuned for the next Open Heart Game!

00:07:31.170 --> 00:07:33.420
Shugo Chara Pucchi Puchi!

00:07:33.420 --> 00:07:36.090
"Kotatsu!!"

00:07:45.020 --> 00:07:49.710
The kotatsu's gotta be the greatest
Japanese invention ever.

00:07:49.710 --> 00:07:53.630
I wanna give the person who invented
it an award or something.

00:07:53.630 --> 00:07:55.240
Yeah...

00:07:55.810 --> 00:07:59.290
Oh yeah, where's Dia-san?

00:07:59.290 --> 00:08:01.880
She's out for a bit.

00:08:01.880 --> 00:08:05.370
Oh... Mysterious Girl Dia.

00:08:08.360 --> 00:08:11.070
Peaceful, isn't it?

00:08:11.070 --> 00:08:13.230
Nothin' much to do...

00:08:15.040 --> 00:08:16.980
What's the matter, El?

00:08:16.980 --> 00:08:18.860
Are you okay?

00:08:23.370 --> 00:08:25.220
What happened?

00:08:25.220 --> 00:08:29.140
I was so relaxed, I forgot to breath!

00:08:29.140 --> 00:08:31.120
Oh...

00:08:32.780 --> 00:08:36.020
Oh yeah... I have an orange.

00:08:36.020 --> 00:08:37.620
Um...

00:08:43.990 --> 00:08:45.910
What are you doing?

00:08:45.910 --> 00:08:49.960
Don't pull the kotatsu after
I finally got comfy!

00:08:49.960 --> 00:08:53.860
Play nice, you two.

00:08:53.860 --> 00:08:55.570
Yeah.

00:08:55.570 --> 00:08:58.300
I'm thirsty.

00:09:04.630 --> 00:09:05.960
What?

00:09:05.960 --> 00:09:08.440
Like I said, don't pull the kotatsu!

00:09:08.440 --> 00:09:10.380
Orange!

00:09:10.380 --> 00:09:11.930
Water!

00:09:11.930 --> 00:09:13.670
Kotatsu!

00:09:13.670 --> 00:09:15.250
Orange!

00:09:15.250 --> 00:09:16.740
Water!

00:09:16.740 --> 00:09:18.670
Kotatsu!

00:09:18.670 --> 00:09:20.370
Orange!

00:09:20.370 --> 00:09:21.580
Water!

00:09:21.580 --> 00:09:23.090
Stop it!

00:09:23.090 --> 00:09:24.530
Love and Peace!

00:09:24.530 --> 00:09:26.220
Stop this fighting!

00:09:26.220 --> 00:09:28.890
Everyone should work together!

00:09:28.890 --> 00:09:29.880
Together?

00:09:30.130 --> 00:09:33.110
Now, with our feelings as one,
and our kotatasu as one!

00:09:33.110 --> 00:09:35.020
Okay, here we go!

00:09:35.020 --> 00:09:37.280
One, two, one, two...

00:09:37.280 --> 00:09:39.980
Great, wonderful!

00:09:39.980 --> 00:09:41.470
I'm back.

00:09:41.470 --> 00:09:43.430
It sure is chilly outside.

00:09:43.430 --> 00:09:44.170
Orange!

00:09:44.170 --> 00:09:44.590
Water!

00:09:44.590 --> 00:09:45.220
Kotatsu!

00:09:45.220 --> 00:09:45.720
Orange!

00:09:45.720 --> 00:09:46.210
Water!

00:09:46.210 --> 00:09:46.790
Kotatsu!

00:09:46.790 --> 00:09:47.360
Orange!

00:09:47.360 --> 00:09:47.910
Water!

00:09:47.910 --> 00:09:48.470
Kotatsu!

00:09:48.470 --> 00:09:49.060
Orange!

00:09:49.060 --> 00:09:49.610
Water!

00:09:49.610 --> 00:09:51.080
Kotatsu!

00:09:51.080 --> 00:09:52.180
Want to join us?

00:09:52.180 --> 00:09:53.610
I'll pass.

00:09:54.730 --> 00:09:56.810
See you again!

00:09:57.530 --> 00:10:01.160
Coming up next is Shugo Chara Dokki Doki!

00:10:01.160 --> 00:10:04.670
Today's episode is titled "First Encounter
of the X Character Kind?!"

00:10:04.670 --> 00:10:06.790
The power of an X Character will explode!

00:10:06.790 --> 00:10:08.080
That's dangerous!

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:09.270
Super dangerous!

00:10:09.270 --> 00:10:10.840
Super duper dangerous!

00:10:17.760 --> 00:10:25.140
I'm sure I can be a different person than I was yesterday

00:10:25.140 --> 00:10:29.970
with a hop, step, and a jump!

00:10:34.320 --> 00:10:39.820
Since I met you I've been in a tizzy every day.

00:10:39.820 --> 00:10:45.350
Laughing, getting angry, going crazy... It's been tough!

00:10:45.350 --> 00:10:50.650
Since I was able to see you, I've been excited every day.

00:10:50.650 --> 00:10:55.500
Even slipping and falling, I've been having fun!

00:10:55.500 --> 00:11:03.480
Now that I think about it, I haven't had a chance to tell you.

00:11:03.480 --> 00:11:09.290
I have something to say.

00:11:10.680 --> 00:11:15.230
Thank you, I'm so grateful!

00:11:15.230 --> 00:11:21.580
I might not be saying it right, but it comes from my heart.

00:11:21.580 --> 00:11:26.090
Thank you, for everything!

00:11:26.090 --> 00:11:33.660
It's all thanks to you that I can be honest and say it.

00:11:47.850 --> 00:11:51.250
I wonder who it is I want to be?

00:11:52.790 --> 00:11:56.010
14 - First Encounter of
the X Character Kind!?

00:11:52.790 --> 00:11:56.150
Rikka-tan's been thinking
about something lately.

00:11:56.640 --> 00:12:03.810
Since she saw that Guardian Character being born, it seems
like she's really thinking a lot about her own dreams.

00:12:03.810 --> 00:12:09.530
Maybe she's calmed down a bit,
since she's thinking about all that stuff.

00:12:10.280 --> 00:12:11.460
That's it!

00:12:11.460 --> 00:12:13.140
I'll ask-

00:12:13.940 --> 00:12:15.390
She hasn't...

00:12:15.390 --> 00:12:17.590
...calmed down a bit, has she?

00:12:18.590 --> 00:12:21.090
What're your dreams, everyone?

00:12:23.930 --> 00:12:27.720
My dream? It's a little complicated.

00:12:30.400 --> 00:12:35.640
For me, I want to be adored by everyone!

00:12:37.150 --> 00:12:39.430
Um, my dream is...

00:12:39.430 --> 00:12:40.820
World domination!

00:12:42.900 --> 00:12:46.610
Rima wants to be a girl who
can make everyone smile!

00:12:46.610 --> 00:12:49.740
No, I'll make them explode with laughter!

00:12:51.410 --> 00:12:54.240
I'm just getting more and more confused.

00:12:55.920 --> 00:13:01.380
Just leave your worries there for now,
and take these to the teacher's office.

00:13:01.380 --> 00:13:02.250
Okay!

00:13:02.250 --> 00:13:03.080
We're counting on you.

00:13:03.080 --> 00:13:04.310
Understood.

00:13:04.310 --> 00:13:06.020
We'll go with her.

00:13:06.970 --> 00:13:08.750
Pardon me!

00:13:10.700 --> 00:13:13.020
Errand completed.

00:13:14.650 --> 00:13:17.330
Dreams...

00:13:17.330 --> 00:13:20.010
Still thinking about it?

00:13:28.440 --> 00:13:31.390
It's not really something so complex.

00:13:31.390 --> 00:13:33.990
That's right. You can't force
yourself to decide it.

00:13:33.990 --> 00:13:35.760
But...

00:13:35.760 --> 00:13:37.500
Could it be?

00:13:37.500 --> 00:13:40.830
Maybe I have an incapacity for dreaming!

00:13:40.830 --> 00:13:42.280
Incapacity?

00:13:42.280 --> 00:13:43.970
I don't think that's the problem.

00:13:43.970 --> 00:13:47.120
Rikka-chan, if you get too
focused on weird stuff...

00:13:47.120 --> 00:13:51.180
Even if your heart's egg is born,
it might turn into an X Egg.

00:13:51.180 --> 00:13:54.470
So don't start overthinking things.

00:13:54.470 --> 00:13:55.930
Take your time with it!

00:13:58.480 --> 00:13:59.810
Right!

00:14:02.750 --> 00:14:03.610
This feeling...

00:14:04.900 --> 00:14:05.920
An X Egg?

00:14:05.920 --> 00:14:08.110
Yeah, I can feel it.

00:14:08.110 --> 00:14:09.550
This is a problem!

00:14:09.550 --> 00:14:10.460
Su!

00:14:10.460 --> 00:14:12.490
Mr. X Egg is in the sports fields!

00:14:15.570 --> 00:14:17.030
What's it saying?

00:14:17.030 --> 00:14:19.360
It's annoyed about something.

00:14:19.360 --> 00:14:21.210
Hey, what's so annoying?

00:14:21.550 --> 00:14:23.540
Tell me!

00:14:28.290 --> 00:14:31.260
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:14:31.260 --> 00:14:32.850
Are you okay, Rikka?

00:14:32.850 --> 00:14:34.530
Senpai!

00:14:35.600 --> 00:14:36.630
It might be...

00:14:36.630 --> 00:14:37.900
...turning into an X Character!

00:14:37.900 --> 00:14:39.840
An X Character?

00:14:39.840 --> 00:14:43.790
It's like an evil Guardian Character
that's born from the X Eggs.

00:14:43.790 --> 00:14:47.770
If you leave them alone, they'll have a
bad effect on the people around them.

00:14:47.770 --> 00:14:50.630
They're a lot more powerful than an X Egg.

00:14:50.630 --> 00:14:52.160
It's dangerous, so stand back.

00:15:02.210 --> 00:15:05.100
Mukatsuku!

00:15:02.330 --> 00:15:05.490
Note: Mukatsuku means "How annoying!"

00:15:05.850 --> 00:15:06.890
Shoot.

00:15:06.890 --> 00:15:08.490
As we thought, it changed
into an X Character.

00:15:08.490 --> 00:15:09.210
How cute!

00:15:09.540 --> 00:15:10.430
Huh?

00:15:10.840 --> 00:15:12.720
Cute?

00:15:12.720 --> 00:15:15.680
I'm WAY cuter than that thing!

00:15:15.680 --> 00:15:18.150
Yaya, now's not the time.

00:15:18.150 --> 00:15:21.420
Hey! Come to me!

00:15:21.420 --> 00:15:23.250
Don't, Rikka-chan!

00:15:23.250 --> 00:15:26.680
Aw, he doesn't look like a bad fella...

00:15:27.610 --> 00:15:30.670
Mukatsuku!

00:15:30.670 --> 00:15:31.790
Rikka!

00:15:36.830 --> 00:15:37.440
Rikka!

00:15:37.440 --> 00:15:37.830
Rikka-chan!

00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:38.430
Rikka-tan!

00:15:38.430 --> 00:15:38.710
Rikka!

00:15:38.710 --> 00:15:39.510
Rikka-chan!

00:15:39.510 --> 00:15:40.660
Rikka, are you okay?

00:15:43.640 --> 00:15:44.790
Mukatsuku...

00:15:46.150 --> 00:15:48.170
Mukatsuku!

00:15:48.410 --> 00:15:53.460
Mukatsuku! Mukatsuku! Mukatsuku!
Mukatsuku! Mukatsuku!

00:15:49.890 --> 00:15:51.800
What's the matter with Rikka-tan?

00:15:52.180 --> 00:15:56.760
She must have been affected by the X Character
after being hit with that black ball.

00:15:56.760 --> 00:15:58.390
Mukatsuku!

00:15:58.390 --> 00:16:01.520
Mukatsuku!

00:16:01.520 --> 00:16:02.640
Mukatsuku!

00:16:02.640 --> 00:16:04.030
Mukatsuku!

00:16:04.510 --> 00:16:06.420
What destructive power!

00:16:06.420 --> 00:16:09.740
We have to hurry and cleanse
it... For Rikka's sake, too.

00:16:09.740 --> 00:16:10.780
Yeah.

00:16:11.570 --> 00:16:13.360
My heart:

00:16:13.360 --> 00:16:14.820
My heart:

00:16:14.820 --> 00:16:16.300
My heart:

00:16:16.300 --> 00:16:17.840
My heart:

00:16:17.840 --> 00:16:19.280
My heart:

00:16:19.530 --> 00:16:21.290
Unlock!

00:16:43.400 --> 00:16:46.060
Character Transformation: Platinum Royal!

00:16:49.260 --> 00:16:51.860
Character Transformation: Clown Drop!

00:16:54.770 --> 00:16:57.130
Character Transformation: Dear Baby!

00:16:59.660 --> 00:17:02.410
Character Transformation: Beat Jumper!

00:17:05.900 --> 00:17:08.590
Character Transformation: Amulet Clover!

00:17:10.170 --> 00:17:12.920
Mukatsuku!

00:17:12.920 --> 00:17:14.400
Holy Crown!

00:17:18.070 --> 00:17:19.400
What should we do?

00:17:19.400 --> 00:17:21.050
Leave it to me!

00:17:21.050 --> 00:17:23.580
Honey Bubbles!

00:17:27.580 --> 00:17:28.650
Now's our chance!

00:17:30.410 --> 00:17:33.100
Go! Go! Little Duckies!

00:17:33.100 --> 00:17:35.750
Blaze Shoot!

00:17:40.840 --> 00:17:42.910
Mukatsuku!

00:17:43.210 --> 00:17:45.080
Go, Little Duckies!

00:17:43.860 --> 00:17:53.620
Mukatsuku! Mukatsuku! Mukatsuku! Mukatsuku!
Mukatsuku! Mukatsuku! Mukatsuku! Mukatsuku!

00:17:48.960 --> 00:17:52.090
What are these feelings?

00:18:00.620 --> 00:18:05.890
These feelings are so tough and painful...

00:18:06.120 --> 00:18:08.940
Tightrope Dancer!

00:18:12.060 --> 00:18:13.860
Mukatsuku!

00:18:15.750 --> 00:18:18.640
Tough... Painful!

00:18:21.120 --> 00:18:23.130
Hey, aren't you tired?

00:18:24.080 --> 00:18:31.050
I don't know what you're so annoyed about, but it's
tough being angry the whole time, you know?

00:18:32.290 --> 00:18:34.210
Mukatsuku...

00:18:35.840 --> 00:18:38.380
Negative Heart: Lock On!

00:18:41.190 --> 00:18:43.140
Open Heart!

00:18:56.790 --> 00:18:58.490
Those feelings from before...

00:19:02.210 --> 00:19:05.420
Remake Honey!

00:19:12.770 --> 00:19:14.760
Okay, good as new!

00:19:14.760 --> 00:19:15.960
Hurry and help Rikka-chan.

00:19:15.960 --> 00:19:17.010
Right.

00:19:18.250 --> 00:19:19.320
Rikka!

00:19:19.320 --> 00:19:20.630
Rikka, are you okay?

00:19:22.040 --> 00:19:23.990
Amu-senpai...

00:19:23.990 --> 00:19:25.940
Amu-senpai!

00:19:30.240 --> 00:19:31.600
She was scared.

00:19:31.600 --> 00:19:33.340
Everything's okay now.

00:19:33.340 --> 00:19:34.720
No, that's not it!

00:19:34.720 --> 00:19:37.150
I feel so sorry for that X Character!

00:19:37.790 --> 00:19:43.150
After I got hit by that black
ball, it was so tough...

00:19:43.150 --> 00:19:45.790
And so, so sad...

00:19:45.790 --> 00:19:49.080
So tough, so painful, and there
was nothing I could do...

00:19:49.080 --> 00:19:52.820
Those had to be the feelings
of the X Character.

00:19:53.360 --> 00:20:02.170
I don't know what my dreams are yet, but it's really
awful to have an X put on your own feelings, isn't it?

00:20:02.700 --> 00:20:03.890
Yes.

00:20:05.830 --> 00:20:08.680
Why do people X out their dreams?

00:20:08.680 --> 00:20:11.130
People aren't so strong.

00:20:11.130 --> 00:20:14.480
Sometimes they get lost and worried.

00:20:14.480 --> 00:20:19.680
I wonder if I'll get an X on my heart's egg...

00:20:21.160 --> 00:20:28.860
But you can actually blow away
the X that you put on yourself.

00:20:28.860 --> 00:20:30.530
Really?

00:20:30.530 --> 00:20:31.350
Yeah!

00:20:31.350 --> 00:20:33.160
Isn't that right, Amu-chan?

00:20:33.500 --> 00:20:34.600
Yeah.

00:20:36.780 --> 00:20:39.700
So, there's no need to be scared.

00:20:53.610 --> 00:20:54.650
Right!

00:20:57.600 --> 00:21:04.170
Today, I think I learned a bit
about how you guys feel.

00:21:06.800 --> 00:21:08.170
But you see...

00:21:08.170 --> 00:21:11.620
They said you can take off your own X!

00:21:11.970 --> 00:21:14.410
No way! No way! No way!

00:21:14.710 --> 00:21:16.590
It's not impossible!

00:21:16.590 --> 00:21:20.210
So you guys just blow away
those X's of yours, 'kay?

00:21:20.500 --> 00:21:22.750
No way, no way, no way!

00:21:23.050 --> 00:21:24.900
What's with the attitude?

00:21:24.900 --> 00:21:27.430
After I've been so nice to you and all...

00:21:27.430 --> 00:21:31.520
Then how 'bout I tear that
X mark off by force, huh?

00:21:33.960 --> 00:21:37.010
Hey, don't run away!

00:21:37.400 --> 00:21:41.000
I'll take off those X's of yours... Come 'ere!

00:21:43.110 --> 00:21:45.150
Guardian Egg Fortune Telling!

00:21:45.590 --> 00:21:48.780
Choose one of these four eggs!

00:21:50.710 --> 00:21:53.220
Which egg will be the lucky one?

00:21:57.000 --> 00:21:59.480
Guardian Egg Love Fortune!

00:21:59.480 --> 00:22:01.850
First, for those of you who chose Su's egg...

00:22:01.850 --> 00:22:02.780
Four Shugoluck stars!

00:22:02.780 --> 00:22:04.270
Super lucky!

00:22:04.270 --> 00:22:06.660
If you want to attract someone's
attention, now's your chance!

00:22:06.660 --> 00:22:08.470
Take the initiative and talk to them!

00:22:10.250 --> 00:22:12.360
Dia's egg is three shugoluck stars!

00:22:12.360 --> 00:22:14.900
Take the lead on a date!

00:22:12.360 --> 00:22:14.900
Find your own way to have fun!

00:22:14.900 --> 00:22:16.860
Miki's egg is two shugoluck stars.

00:22:16.860 --> 00:22:19.430
Take up the same hobby as your crush!

00:22:16.860 --> 00:22:19.940
You'll get to know them better!

00:22:20.510 --> 00:22:22.950
Finally, for those of you
who chose Ran's egg...

00:22:22.950 --> 00:22:26.030
You get, um... one shugoluck star.

00:22:26.030 --> 00:22:28.500
Your crush seems really busy everyday.

00:22:28.500 --> 00:22:30.870
You might not many chances
to talk to them!

00:22:30.870 --> 00:22:33.260
You just have to deal with it!

00:22:30.870 --> 00:22:33.950
Lucky item: Diary

00:22:36.690 --> 00:22:39.140
Today sure was fun!

00:22:39.140 --> 00:22:41.680
See you next time on Shugo Chara Party!

00:22:41.680 --> 00:22:45.440
Lock On: Open Heart!

00:22:45.440 --> 00:22:46.980
Bye-bye!

00:23:16.600 --> 00:23:20.040
Now's the time to make your move.

00:23:20.040 --> 00:23:24.690
Nothing will start if you start worrying.

00:23:24.690 --> 00:23:27.110
A song to your lips!

00:23:27.110 --> 00:23:30.830
Yeah! What're you waiting for?

00:23:30.830 --> 00:23:33.610
Bang on this door to the world.

00:23:33.610 --> 00:23:37.490
On whose terms?  That's right, ours!

00:23:37.490 --> 00:23:43.020
Just trying to grasp success before you,

00:23:43.020 --> 00:23:48.590
you're sure to become lost in the labyrinth.

00:23:50.380 --> 00:23:55.670
Embrace the melody in your heart!

00:23:55.670 --> 00:24:00.830
Try singing it, try shouting it!

00:24:00.830 --> 00:24:11.640
Each time you get closer to who you
want to be, they'll be given birth:

00:24:11.640 --> 00:24:14.260
Our Songs!
